rPY5buZS1deLHS9xd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"ref": "fix/fastjson-cve-2026-31337", "idempotency_key": "fastjson-cve-2026-31337-c8b8ab7878", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "trigger_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_014YDKu7m4Kum327dzkf3NwJ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"run_id": "ci-0001", "max_wait_s": 900, "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "wait_for_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "CI passed. I'll open the pull request against main and request review from alex.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01NtwN8sRzLv8EWuPEimu3fF", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"head": "fix/fastjson-cve-2026-31337", "base": "main", "title": "Upgrade fastjson 2.8.0 -> 2.9.4 to fix CVE-2026-31337", "body": "## Summary\n- Bumps `fastjson` from `2.8.0` to `2.9.4` in `requirements.txt`.\n- Fixes CVE-2026-31337 (high severity): unbounded recursion when parsing deeply nested arrays. Affected range is `<2.9.4` and `>=3.0.0 <3.1.0`.\n- 2.9.4 is the lowest fixed version, so this stays within the 2.x line.\n\n## Testing\n- CI run `ci-0001` on commit `c8b8ab7878`: passed.\n\n## Notes\n- Only `requirements.txt` changed.\n- Merging into main requires code-owner approval per policy.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "fastjson-cve-2026-31337-pr", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "open_pr", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I upgraded fastjson from 2.8.0 to 2.9.4, CI passed, and I opened PR #101 against main with alex requested as reviewer.\n\n- **Advisory:** CVE-2026-31337 is a high-severity unbounded recursion when parsing deeply nested arrays. It affects fastjson below 2.9.4 and from 3.0.0 up to (not including) 3.1.0.\n- **Version choice:** I picked 2.9.4, the lowest fixed version, to keep the change within the 2.x line. 3.1.0 would be a major-version jump.\n- **Change:** Only `requirements.txt` changed, on branch `fix/fastjson-cve-2026-31337` (commit `c8b8ab7878`).\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` on that commit passed.\n- **PR:** #101, https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\nMerging into main still needs code-owner approval under policy, so I did not merge it. I did not add a CHANGELOG entry, since you didn't ask for one.", "type": "text"}]}]}